        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "23b9392b-2e5e-3fa4-9de2-a40f2cd2d707",
                "word": "laksheid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "50d49b5c-3c80-4ac3-8300-b8fd429c2846",
                        "entry_id": "23b9392b-2e5e-3fa4-9de2-a40f2cd2d707",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "laksheden"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "63df184c-1268-3e05-85a4-cd5aa049b7b3",
                        "entry_id": "23b9392b-2e5e-3fa4-9de2-a40f2cd2d707",
                        "glosses": [
                            "van een persoon dat deze te lui of te onnadenkend is om iets te doen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c1123aca-39c4-4a86-b989-9e03561de9fc",
                                "sense_id": "63df184c-1268-3e05-85a4-cd5aa049b7b3",
                                "text": "Een grote meerderheid vindt het daarentegen wel goed dat de jeugd beschermd wordt tegen middelen die schadelijk zijn. Sommige respondenten vinden dat echter vooral een taak voor de ouders, in plaats van voor de overheid. Een stemmer verwijt ouders laksheid. „Zij kiezen vaak de makkelijkste weg, nemen geen verantwoordelijkheid.” Anderen geloven juist dat voorlichting over de drankjes kinderen ervan weerhoudt ze te drinken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d962a0d5-4812-44fc-ac06-1eff9cf71d04",
                                "sense_id": "63df184c-1268-3e05-85a4-cd5aa049b7b3",
                                "text": "Terwijl de onvrede bij ’gewone’ Nederlanders groeit over de storingen bij Nederlandse banken, zijn ook programmeurs en netwerkbeheerders verbaasd over de grote problemen door DDoS-aanvallen. Eigenlijk zijn die cyberproblemen redelijk gemakkelijk op te lossen, maar banken falen gewoon, zeggen ze. „Nederland zou wereldwijd koploper moeten zijn. Dit is puur laksheid.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6cfe1570-9572-43bf-994c-25085629590d",
                                "sense_id": "63df184c-1268-3e05-85a4-cd5aa049b7b3",
                                "text": "Eén ochtend sprak ene doctor Ring Lundqvist, die de directeur was geweest van de jeugdgevangenis Roxtuna maar ermee was gestopt vanwege alle laksheid."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2bcdd466-8480-4cdc-b5b4-28cc1fe92cb4",
                        "source_entry_id": "23b9392b-2e5e-3fa4-9de2-a40f2cd2d707",
                        "source_sense_id": "63df184c-1268-3e05-85a4-cd5aa049b7b3",
                        "target_lang_word": "laxity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "laxity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18f84950-ea48-386b-82bd-944f41a6c08c",
                                        "entry_id": "cb05f9d8-3b24-3972-ae56-ce7546c0edf8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being lax; looseness, lack of tension."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c7d6fe92-c24e-322c-8f07-5746ac27c261",
                                        "entry_id": "cb05f9d8-3b24-3972-ae56-ce7546c0edf8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moral looseness; lack of rigorousness or strictness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3a4e669d-07a2-4c64-b218-a2731a238ecf",
                                                "sense_id": "c7d6fe92-c24e-322c-8f07-5746ac27c261",
                                                "text": "In these days of laxity, and anythingism in religion, even those of whom we might hope better things do not appear exercised, with the apostle Paul, to have always a conscience void of offence towards God and towards men."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c484e41-9364-42ba-af00-550a21ab3960",
                                                "sense_id": "c7d6fe92-c24e-322c-8f07-5746ac27c261",
                                                "text": "It is no accident that capital punishment is reentering our society on the wave of the conservative reaction to the permissiveness and laxity of the past two decades."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "856aca52-5c8a-44c8-99f5-0d1a162c3aaf",
                        "source_entry_id": "23b9392b-2e5e-3fa4-9de2-a40f2cd2d707",
                        "source_sense_id": "63df184c-1268-3e05-85a4-cd5aa049b7b3",
                        "target_lang_word": "weakness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "weakness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf62c1ad-7cdb-3dc5-89ae-9868969c3972",
                                        "entry_id": "ba773e2e-a9ba-3c50-9f10-a05a2b3fcf3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The condition of being weak."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "709aee5d-bb55-43ac-84df-fab26df812a5",
                                                "sense_id": "cf62c1ad-7cdb-3dc5-89ae-9868969c3972",
                                                "text": "Near-synonyms: debility, frailty, vulnerability; vincibility"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a437495d-6c64-4e54-833d-b1ab903abc18",
                                                "sense_id": "cf62c1ad-7cdb-3dc5-89ae-9868969c3972",
                                                "text": "In a small number of horses, muscle weakness may progress to paralysis."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c811d018-84c5-3adf-aa53-a0a99342ec6f",
                                        "entry_id": "ba773e2e-a9ba-3c50-9f10-a05a2b3fcf3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An inadequate quality; fault."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88afc5dd-7121-4978-abd7-b97342343b2c",
                                                "sense_id": "c811d018-84c5-3adf-aa53-a0a99342ec6f",
                                                "text": "His inability to speak in front of an audience was his weakness."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1568eabd-6c6b-40be-a520-5c52857e92df",
                                                "sense_id": "c811d018-84c5-3adf-aa53-a0a99342ec6f",
                                                "text": "The only weakness in her plan was its reliance on the electricity being up and running."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41e51333-8a44-43b2-97be-797095ec7f99",
                                                "sense_id": "c811d018-84c5-3adf-aa53-a0a99342ec6f",
                                                "text": "The story struck the depressingly familiar note with which true stories ring in the tried ears of experienced policemen. No one queried it. It was in the classic pattern of human weakness, mean and embarrassing and sad."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3798e124-0445-4315-927e-ca7b8cdc2fc5",
                                                "sense_id": "c811d018-84c5-3adf-aa53-a0a99342ec6f",
                                                "text": "Bradford had preyed on Villa's inability to defend set pieces, corners in particular, in their first-leg win and took advantage of the weakness again as Hanson equalised to restore their two-goal aggregate lead."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "875688e3-c30a-4b39-8dbc-bfbe881cdc8b",
                                                "sense_id": "c811d018-84c5-3adf-aa53-a0a99342ec6f",
                                                "text": "The compulsion to expose, renegotiate, or reinvent the strengths and weaknesses of dance tradition offers little in its final outcome to attract the average dance-goer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c34c3ff1-098c-4b7b-8bd4-bcbf7eccce38",
                                                "sense_id": "c811d018-84c5-3adf-aa53-a0a99342ec6f",
                                                "text": "Such a male-dominated environment is also likely to contribute to the lingering presence of an outdated belief that expressing feelings and demonstrating emotion is a sign of weakness, deterring some men from discussing their problems."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4dad797c-d116-39c2-b843-4e23c71b420f",
                                        "entry_id": "ba773e2e-a9ba-3c50-9f10-a05a2b3fcf3b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A special fondness or obsessing desire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2e13932-9d15-4fbd-8371-295abdf5df71",
                                                "sense_id": "4dad797c-d116-39c2-b843-4e23c71b420f",
                                                "text": "She is an athlete who has a weakness for chocolate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
